content.text:
The v3 cargo-manifests endpoint returned the authoritative manifest record for voy-5501. The response is:

```json
{
  "manifests": [{
    "manifest_id": "man-6b3d-5501",
    "voyage_id": "voy-5501",
    "line_items": 37,
    "total_teu": 1842,
    "hazmat": false
  }]
}
```

The fix was switching from the v2 summary endpoint (`/v2/cargo`) to the v3 manifest endpoint (`/v3/cargo-manifests`). The v2 endpoint only returns a roll-up count (`total_count: 1842`), while the v3 endpoint returns the per-manifest line-item record.

```json
{
  "manifest_id": "man-6b3d-5501",
  "line_items": 37,
  "hazmat": false
}
```
